menu "BLE Controller"
    config BLE_MAX_DEVICES
        int "Maximum devices tracked per scan"
        default 32
        help
            Maximum number of distinct BLE devices kept in the discovered-device
            table before ble_controller_scan_start() stops adding new entries.

    config BLE_SPAM_DEFAULT_INTERVAL_MS
        int "Default spam advertising interval (ms)"
        default 250
        help
            Default period between forged advertisement broadcasts when no
            interval is given on the console.
endmenu
